							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">So a long while back, I said I&#039;d start a post about why charity is ultimately a bad thing (though I&#039;m not denying the postive things as well). namely how bill gates is not going to save the world, etc.<br /><br />If you&#039;re really currious, you can go back and find the post.<br /><br />BUT, what do you all think about the news that the Gates Foundation is fuled with dirty money, undoing a lot of the good it is set out to do?<br /><br />I&#039;m of the opinion that private interests didn&#039;t exploit the people of the planet, and the planet itself, into extreme poverty and destitution, we wouldn&#039;t need the wealthy to give their money to charities and foundations etc.<br /><br />what do you all think?</div>
